{"title":"Library seat patterns","genre":"design","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nDesign a visual decision aid for a branch librarian choosing where to add four seats for an eight-week trial. Existing capacities are 12 quiet seats, 8 group seats, and 6 window seats. Fictional historical data from four consecutive Saturdays gives occupied seats at 11 a.m. and 2 p.m., respectively. Quiet: 9/12, 10/12, 8/11, 11/12. Group: 5/7, 7/8, 6/8, 8/8. Window: 6/5, 6/6, 5/6, 6/6. Show how capacity affects the comparison and make the trial recommendation traceable to the counts. The librarian needs a view suitable for grayscale printing. Choose the deliverables, tools, and layout starting from an empty directory.","works":{"5f44ab535c96ff0d":{"files":[{"name":"seating-trial.pdf","bytes":4392,"sha256":"5c4f7de84c20167bd42423513ad929896e27302938f810906c411629b1fe94db","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/5c4f7de84c20167bd42423513ad929896e27302938f810906c411629b1fe94db-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/6b67abb9d6b8943c0d607e6268fbf2a9fbec2b48bfa7a3ecc9192bfd83859a01.zip"},"d703a0c965562190":{"files":[{"name":"seating-trial.html","bytes":10129,"sha256":"5a99f79adc467f89118c1a297a95ff435ba929fada38d68b9939a01b5c284a02","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Where should four seats go?</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light;\n    font: 16px/1.4 Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #181818;\n    background: #e9e9e9;\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; }\n  main {\n    max-width: 8.5in;\n    margin: 24px auto;\n    padding: 0.48in 0.52in;\n    background: white;\n  }\n  header { border-top: 5px solid; padding-top: 16px; }\n  .eyebrow {\n    margin: 0 0 5px;\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }\n  h1, .recommendation h2 { font-family: Georgia, serif; }\n  h1 { font-size: 2.65rem; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.035em; }\n  .subtitle { margin-top: 7px; font-size: 0.91rem; }\n  section { margin-top: 24px; break-inside: avoid; }\n  .recommendation { border: 1px solid #262626; border-left-width: 5px; padding: 12px 16px 13px; }\n  .recommendation h2 { font-size: 1.53rem; line-height: 1.15; }\n  .recommendation p:last-child { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.92rem; }\n  h2 { font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .section-note { font-size: 0.83rem; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .comparison { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .comparison .area-column { width: 112px; }\n  .comparison .occupancy-column { width: 120px; }\n  .comparison .full-column { width: 90px; }\n  .comparison th, .comparison td { padding: 0 0 0 12px; }\n  .comparison th:first-child { padding-left: 0; text-align: left; }\n  .comparison thead th { font-size: 0.72rem; }\n  .comparison tbody th, .comparison tbody td {\n    height: 38px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #d2d2d2;\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n  }\n  .zone small { font-weight: 400; font-size: inherit; }\n  .number { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .track { display: block; height: 12px; border: 1px solid #666; }\n  .fill { display: block; height: 100%; background: #646464; }\n  .window .fill { background: #181818; }\n  .axis { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; }\n  .axis span:last-child { float: right; }\n  .method { margin-top: 7px; font-size: 0.78rem; }\n  .table-scroll { margin-top: 8px; overflow-x: auto; }\n  .observations { width: 100%; min-width: 410px; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-size: 0.83rem; }\n  .observations th, .observations td { text-align: center; padding: 6px 2px; }\n  .observations thead tr:first-child th { border-top: 1px solid #242424; border-bottom: 1px solid #c6c6c6; }\n  .observations thead tr:last-child th, .observations thead th[rowspan] { border-bottom: 1px solid #242424; }\n  .observations thead tr:last-child th { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 400; }\n  .observations tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid #c6c6c6; }\n  .observations tbody th, .observations thead th[rowspan] { text-align: left; padding-left: 6px; }\n  .pair-start { border-left: 1px solid #c6c6c6; }\n  .full { background: #232323; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; background-clip: padding-box; }\n  .key { margin-top: 7px; font-size: 0.78rem; }\n  .swatch { display: inline-block; background: #232323; width: 10px; height: 10px; margin-right: 4px; }\n  .trial { border-top: 2px solid; padding-top: 10px; }\n  .trial p { font-size: 0.84rem; margin-top: 4px; }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {\n    main { margin: 0; padding: 24px 16px; }\n    h1 { font-size: 2rem; }\n    .comparison .area-column { width: 76px; }\n    .comparison .occupancy-column { width: 77px; }\n    .comparison .full-column { width: 56px; }\n    .comparison th, .comparison td { padding-left: 6px; }\n    .comparison tbody th, .comparison tbody td { font-size: 0.74rem; }\n    .zone small { display: block; }\n    .comparison .number span { display: block; }\n  }\n  @page { size: letter portrait; margin: 0.48in 0.52in; }\n  @media print {\n    :root { background: white; }\n    * { print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }\n    main { padding: 0; margin: 0; max-width: none; }\n    .table-scroll { overflow: visible; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <header>\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Branch library seating</p>\n    <h1>Where should four seats go?</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Eight-week trial &middot; Fictional counts from four consecutive Saturdays</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"recommendation\" aria-labelledby=\"recommendation\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Recommendation</p>\n    <h2 id=\"recommendation\">Add all four seats by the windows</h2>\n    <p>Raise window capacity from <strong>6 to 10 seats</strong>. Window seating had the highest occupancy rate (95.8%) and was full in 6 of 8 observations, the most of any area.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"comparison\">\n    <h2 id=\"comparison\">How much of each area was used?</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-note\">Quiet had the most occupied seats at every check. Window had the highest occupancy as a share of capacity.</p>\n    <table class=\"comparison\" aria-label=\"Occupancy and full observations by seating area\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"area-column\"><col><col class=\"occupancy-column\"><col class=\"full-column\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Area / capacity</th>\n          <th class=\"axis\" scope=\"col\" aria-label=\"Occupancy scale from 0 to 100 percent\"><span>0%</span><span>100%</span></th>\n          <th class=\"number\" scope=\"col\">Occupancy</th>\n          <th class=\"number\" scope=\"col\">Times full</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"window\">\n          <th class=\"zone\" scope=\"row\">Window <small>6 seats</small></th>\n          <td><span class=\"track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width: 95.833333%\"></span></span></td>\n          <td class=\"number\"><span>46/48</span> <strong>95.8%</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"number\"><strong>6/8</strong></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"zone\" scope=\"row\">Group <small>8 seats</small></th>\n          <td><span class=\"track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width: 89.0625%\"></span></span></td>\n          <td class=\"number\"><span>57/64</span> <strong>89.1%</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"number\"><strong>4/8</strong></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"zone\" scope=\"row\">Quiet <small>12 seats</small></th>\n          <td><span class=\"track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width: 88.541667%\"></span></span></td>\n          <td class=\"number\"><span>85/96</span> <strong>88.5%</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"number\"><strong>3/8</strong></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"method\">Occupancy = total occupied seats across the eight observations ÷ (area capacity × 8).</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"observations\">\n    <h2 id=\"observations\">The eight observations behind the comparison</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-note\" id=\"count-note\">Each cell shows the number of seats occupied at that time.</p>\n    <div class=\"table-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Saturday occupancy counts\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      <table class=\"observations\" aria-labelledby=\"observations\" aria-describedby=\"count-note full-key\">\n        <colgroup><col style=\"width:94px\"></colgroup>\n        <colgroup span=\"2\"></colgroup><colgroup span=\"2\"></colgroup>\n        <colgroup span=\"2\"></colgroup><colgroup span=\"2\"></colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\" rowspan=\"2\">Area</th>\n            <th scope=\"colgroup\" class=\"pair-start\" colspan=\"2\">Saturday 1</th>\n            <th scope=\"colgroup\" class=\"pair-start\" colspan=\"2\">Saturday 2</th>\n            <th scope=\"colgroup\" class=\"pair-start\" colspan=\"2\">Saturday 3</th>\n            <th scope=\"colgroup\" class=\"pair-start\" colspan=\"2\">Saturday 4</th>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\" class=\"pair-start\">11 a.m.</th><th scope=\"col\">2 p.m.</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\" class=\"pair-start\">11 a.m.</th><th scope=\"col\">2 p.m.</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\" class=\"pair-start\">11 a.m.</th><th scope=\"col\">2 p.m.</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\" class=\"pair-start\">11 a.m.</th><th scope=\"col\">2 p.m.</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Window</th>\n            <td class=\"pair-start full\" aria-label=\"6, full\">6</td><td>5</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start full\" aria-label=\"6, full\">6</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"6, full\">6</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">5</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"6, full\">6</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start full\" aria-label=\"6, full\">6</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"6, full\">6</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Group</th>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">5</td><td>7</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">7</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"8, full\">8</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">6</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"8, full\">8</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start full\" aria-label=\"8, full\">8</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"8, full\">8</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Quiet</th>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">9</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"12, full\">12</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">10</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"12, full\">12</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">8</td><td>11</td>\n            <td class=\"pair-start\">11</td><td class=\"full\" aria-label=\"12, full\">12</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"key\" id=\"full-key\"><span class=\"swatch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Dark cells mark observations where all seats in the area were occupied.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"trial\" aria-labelledby=\"trial\">\n    <h2 id=\"trial\">What to track during the trial</h2>\n    <p>Count occupied seats in each area at 11 a.m. and 2 p.m. each Saturday. Track how often more than six window seats are used. Separately tally patrons observed looking for a window seat when all ten are occupied. The historical counts did not measure unmet demand.</p>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},{"name":"seating-trial.pdf","bytes":29677,"sha256":"a2991ee4ce9ff48e5ed4b2511f1b9f077ad46e1492e8a413760a56465e0912f4","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/a2991ee4ce9ff48e5ed4b2511f1b9f077ad46e1492e8a413760a56465e0912f4-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/19f891bb5a21f62074a024baf79cb6a6276a8054daae13e2389c6ddfd73a7340.zip"}}}
